      "response": [
        {
          "value": "Here is the name and parameters for a PowerShell function that will return a GUID in the specified format:\n\n```powershell\nfunction Get-FormattedGuid {\n    <#\n    .SYNOPSIS\n    Returns a GUID in the format '83BA6C26-A2D6-437D-B1B5-E4169AFA4187'.\n\n    .DESCRIPTION\n    This function generates a new GUID and formats it as an uppercase string\n    without curly braces.\n\n    .EXAMPLE\n    Get-FormattedGuid\n    # Output: '83BA6C26-A2D6-437D-B1B5-E4169AFA4187'\n    #>\n    param ()\n\n    # Generate a new GUID and format it\n    return [Guid]::NewGuid().ToString().ToUpper()\n}\n```\n\n### Usage:\nRun the function in PowerShell to get a GUID in the desired format:\n\n```powershell\nGet-FormattedGuid\n```\n\nThis will output a GUID like `83BA6C26-A2D6-437D-B1B5-E4169AFA4187`.",
          "supportThemeIcons": false,
          "supportHtml": false,
