        },
        {
          "value": " file contains a `configurations` array that holds individual launch configurations. To merge multiple files, you need to combine all the `configurations` arrays into one.\n\n### 2. **Manually Merge Configurations**\nCopy the `configurations` array from each ",
          "supportThemeIcons": false,
