              "code": "Invoke-Pester -Path C:\\Dropbox\\whertzing\\GitHub\\ATAP.Utilities\\src\\ATAP.Utilities.Powershell `\n  -ExcludePath */Resources/*, */Releases/* `\n  -OutputFormat NUnitXml `\n  -OutputFile C:\\Dropbox\\whertzing\\GitHub\\ATAP.Utilities\\src\\ATAP.Utilities.Powershell\\_generated\\TestResults\\results.xml\n",
              "language": "powershell",
              "markdownBeforeBlock": "To exclude multiple directories (e.g.,  and ) when running `Invoke-Pester`, you can use the `-ExcludePath` parameter with a comma-separated list of paths or patterns. Here's how you can modify your command:\n\n"
