      "response": [
        {
          "value": "To delete a ProGet feed via the API in PowerShell, you typically send a `POST` request to the `/api/feeds/delete` endpoint with the feed name and an admin API key.\n\nHere’s how you can do it inside your `Remove-ProGetFeedSet` function:\n\n````powershell\n",
          "supportThemeIcons": false,
          "supportHtml": false,
          "baseUri": {
            "$mid": 1,
            "path": "/c:/Dropbox/whertzing/GitHub/ATAP.Utilities/",
            "scheme": "file"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "codeblockUri",
          "uri": {
            "$mid": 1,
            "fsPath": "c:\\Dropbox\\whertzing\\GitHub\\ATAP.Utilities\\src\\ATAP.Utilities.IAC.Ansible.Powershell\\public\\Remove-ProGetFeedSet.ps1",
            "_sep": 1,
            "external": "file:///c%3A/Dropbox/whertzing/GitHub/ATAP.Utilities/src/ATAP.Utilities.IAC.Ansible.Powershell/public/Remove-ProGetFeedSet.ps1",
            "path": "/c:/Dropbox/whertzing/GitHub/ATAP.Utilities/src/ATAP.Utilities.IAC.Ansible.Powershell/public/Remove-ProGetFeedSet.ps1",
            "scheme": "file"
          }
        },
        {
          "value": "for ($feedNamesIndex = 0; $feedNamesIndex -lt $feedNames.Count; $feedNamesIndex++) {\n  $feedName = $feedNames[$feedNamesIndex]\n  $feed = $($global:settings[$global:ConfigRootKeys['PackageRepositoriesCollectionConfigRootKey']][$feedName])\n  $feedShortName = $feed.ShortName\n\n  $uri = \"http://${ProGetHost}:${ProGetBasePort}/api/feeds/delete\"\n  $headers = @{ \"X-ApiKey\" = $adminApiKey }\n  $body = @{\n    feed = $feedShortName\n  }\n\n  if ($PSCmdlet.ShouldProcess(\"ProGet\", \"Delete feed '$feedShortName'\")) {\n    try {\n      $response = Invoke-RestMethod -Uri $uri -Method Post -Headers $headers -Body $body\n      Write-PSFMessage -Level Important -Message \"Deleted feed '$feedShortName' successfully.\"\n    } catch {\n      Write-PSFMessage -Level Error -Message \"Failed to delete feed '$feedShortName': $_\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n````\n\n**Notes:**\n- Replace `${ProGetHost}` with your actual ProGet host variable if not already set.\n- The `feed` parameter in the body should match the feed’s short name.\n- The API key must have admin rights.\n- The `ShouldProcess` block ensures support for `-WhatIf` and `-Confirm`.",
          "supportThemeIcons": false,
          "supportHtml": false,
          "baseUri": {
            "$mid": 1,
            "path": "/c:/Dropbox/whertzing/GitHub/ATAP.Utilities/",
            "scheme": "file"
          }
        }
      ],
      "responseId": "response_3ebf01e9-1b2e-4637-938f-66c45fccd0a3",
      "result": {
        "timings": {
