      "response": [
        {
          "value": "The PowerShell **preference variable** for error action is:\n\n```powershell\n$ErrorActionPreference\n```\n\n### Usage:\nSet it to control the default error handling behavior for all commands in the current session or script:\n\n- `Continue` (default): Display error and continue.\n- `SilentlyContinue`: Suppress error messages and continue.\n- `Stop`: Stop execution on error.\n- `Inquire`: Ask what to do on error.\n- `Ignore`: Ignore errors (no error record in `$Error`).\n\n**Example:**\n```powershell\n$ErrorActionPreference = 'SilentlyContinue'\n```\n\nThis will make all errors silently ignored unless overridden by a cmdlet’s `-ErrorAction` parameter.",
          "supportThemeIcons": false,
          "supportHtml": false,
          "baseUri": {
            "$mid": 1,
            "path": "/c:/Dropbox/whertzing/GitHub/ATAP.Utilities/",
            "scheme": "file"
          }
        }
