              "code": "$ErrorActionPreference\n",
              "language": "powershell",
              "markdownBeforeBlock": "The PowerShell **preference variable** for error action is:\n\n"
            },
            {
              "code": "$ErrorActionPreference = 'SilentlyContinue'\n",
              "language": "powershell",
              "markdownBeforeBlock": "\n### Usage:\nSet it to control the default error handling behavior for all commands in the current session or script:\n\n- `Continue` (default): Display error and continue.\n- `SilentlyContinue`: Suppress error messages and continue.\n- `Stop`: Stop execution on error.\n- `Inquire`: Ask what to do on error.\n- `Ignore`: Ignore errors (no error record in `$Error`).\n\n**Example:**\n"
