      "response": [
        {
          "value": "Next, you’ll want to get your PR reviewed and validated before merging:\n\n1. Assign one or more reviewers on GitHub.  \n2. Wait for CI to finish and turn green.  \n3. Address any review comments (push follow-up commits to your branch).  \n4. Once approvals are in and CI is passing, merge your PR (Squash & merge or Merge commit).  \n5. Delete the remote bugfix branch if it’s no longer needed.",
          "supportThemeIcons": false,
          "supportHtml": false,
          "baseUri": {
            "$mid": 1,
            "path": "/c:/Dropbox/whertzing/GitHub/ATAP.Utilities/",
