          "value": "The merge you performed in GitHub’s UI was applied to the **remote** `main` (i.e. `origin/main`), so there’s nothing new to push.  What you’ll want to do now is update your **local** `main`:\n\n```bash\ngit fetch origin\ngit checkout main\ngit pull origin main\n```\n\nAfter that your local `main` will include the merged commits.",
