          "value": "You can abort the in-progress merge and return your working tree to its pre-merge state:\n\n````bash\ngit merge --abort\n````\n\nOr, in VS Code’s Git UI:\n\n1. Open the Command Palette (F1)  \n2. Run `Git: Abort Merge`  \n\nThis will cancel the merge and restore your local main.",
