      "response": [
        {
          "value": "To delete a local Git branch:\n\n````bash\n# 1. Switch off the branch you want to delete\ngit checkout main\n\n# 2. Delete the branch (will refuse if unmerged)\ngit branch -d <branchName>\n\n# 3. If you need to force-delete (unmerged commits will be lost)\ngit branch -D <branchName>\n````\n\n• Replace `<branchName>` with the name of your branch.  \n• Make sure you’re not checked out on the branch you’re deleting.",
          "supportThemeIcons": false,
          "supportHtml": false,
          "baseUri": {
            "$mid": 1,
            "path": "/c:/Dropbox/whertzing/GitHub/ATAP.Utilities/",
            "scheme": "file"
