      "response": [
        {
          "value": "If you don’t see “GitHub Copilot > Chat: History Location” in the Settings UI, you can add it by hand to your user (or workspace) settings JSON.\n\n1. Open Settings (JSON)  \n   • Press F1 (or View → Command Palette) → **Preferences: Open Settings (JSON)**  \n\n2. Add the Copilot-Chat historyLocation entry, e.g.:\n\n```jsonc\n// in your user settings (settings.json)\n{\n  // … other settings …\n\n  // store Copilot chat history globally instead of per-workspace\n  \"github.copilot-chat.historyLocation\": \"global\"\n}\n```\n\nValid values are:\n- `\"workspace\"` (the default)  \n- `\"global\"`\n\n3. Save and restart VS Code.  \n\nNow **Show Chats** will surface all threads (global across repos) rather than only the current workspace.",
          "supportThemeIcons": false,
          "supportHtml": false,
          "baseUri": {
            "$mid": 1,
            "path": "/c:/Dropbox/whertzing/GitHub/ATAP.Utilities/",
            "scheme": "file"
          }
        }
      ],
