              "language": "jsonc",
              "markdownBeforeBlock": "If you don’t see “GitHub Copilot > Chat: History Location” in the Settings UI, you can add it by hand to your user (or workspace) settings JSON.\n\n1. Open Settings (JSON)  \n   • Press F1 (or View → Command Palette) → **Preferences: Open Settings (JSON)**  \n\n2. Add the Copilot-Chat historyLocation entry, e.g.:\n\n"
            }
